---
mm: 1.1
kind: test
name: shell
use: mm.test
use: mm.shell
unit: tests/mm/shell/environment.cpp
unit: tests/mm/shell/current_shell.cpp
unit: tests/mm/shell/parse_script.cpp
unit: tests/main.cpp
option: buildable-target no
---

# mm.shell test target

Covers the three parts of mm.shell separately: the environment accessors, the interactive shell name, and the script parser. The environment cases act on this process's own variables, so each one clears the name it uses before and after.

buildable-target no because this suite uses mm.shell, which is host-only. The
other suites build for a target and fail only on the linker flags a freestanding
link needs, so they are deliberately not marked.
